tuba registers skull microCT volumes to published brain atlases for
transcranial-ultrasound simulation. It does NOT bundle or redistribute any of
the datasets listed below. Each is fetched and staged locally by the user
(see `src/tuba/data/sources.toml` and the `src/tuba/data/fetch_*.py` scripts),
and each is governed by its OWN license and citation terms, which you must
observe IN ADDITION TO tuba's MIT license. Some datasets are NON-COMMERCIAL or
carry unstated terms — flagged below. Figures reproduced in `docs/*/manuscript.*`
are derived from these same sources under the terms noted.

`src/tuba/data/sources.toml` is the single source of truth for provenance
(source URLs, DOIs, licenses, checksums, voxel sizes); this NOTICE summarizes it.

